## Why This Is Asked
Real systems synchronize thousands of threads across NUMA nodes; a lock-free barrier minimizes cache thrash and jitter in schedulers and regression tests.

## Key Concepts
- Generation counters with per-thread sense flips
- Atomic arrivals and a single release owner
